    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village is part of the Gila River Indian Community, a tribal area in Arizona.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://kids.kiddle.co/Sweet_Water_Village,_Arizona"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Sweet Water Village has no municipal government; it relies on the broader tribal governance structure.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://kids.kiddle.co/Sweet_Water_Village,_Arizona"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Located in Pinal County, Sweet Water Village sits at latitude 33.1317 and longitude –111.8447.",
